{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51844","headline":"采菱女 · 无名氏","name":"采菱女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日期何去？青春只自矜。\n艳歌呈几曲，江畔采新菱，望浦思同济，轻舟喜共乘。\n翠（一作叶）将眉比色，声与调相应。\n荡漾微波散，清泠远水澄。\n更看池际影，若对玉壶冰。\n（同上二○八《乐府》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}